      "id": "DC_kwDOKrJqmc4BEbYa",
      "body": "I installed the latest version via MacOS on an Orbic RC400L with NO SIM.  The install was completed OK, no warnings.  Green line after reboot.  I enabled \"Test Heuristic\", and did receive a warning (dotted yellow).  Logs show a SIB1 message every 4 minutes, with a what appears to be a Verizon (311-480) CID.  \r\n\r\nThe screen shows NO SIM, and there is physical slot is empty.  So it is clearly working with no sim to some extent.  I would assume that I would miss certain heuristics?  ",
